@startuml sequence_drag
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Drag the Track

actor User
participant ReviewScrubberComponent as Comp
participant ReviewScrubberController as Ctrl
participant DashboardModeService as Mode
participant "Review Tile" as Tile

User -> Comp: drag slider to index 42
Comp -> Ctrl: scrubTo(42)
Ctrl -> Ctrl: debounce 100 ms
Ctrl -> Ctrl: isoDateAtIndex(start, 42)
Ctrl -> Mode: setSelectedReviewDate('2026-03-15')
Mode --> Tile: signal change
Tile -> Tile: re-fetch / re-render

@enduml
